"""Bundled dashboard assets; all evidence is rendered with textContent."""
HTML = '''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Agent Replay · Your workspace</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script src="/app.js" defer></script></head><body><header><a href="#home">◈ Agent Replay</a><span>LOCAL · PRIVATE · OFFLINE</span><button id="theme">Day / night</button></header><nav aria-label="Workspace"><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#sources">Sources & trust</a><a href="#import">Import evidence</a><a href="#results">Results</a><a href="#help">Help & legal</a></nav><main><p id="notice" role="status">Connecting to your local workspace…</p>
<section id="home"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EVIDENCE, UNDER YOUR CONTROL</p><h1>Understand what your agent knew.</h1><p>Reconstruct an incident, review supplied claims, or attest observations from your own source. Nothing leaves this computer.</p><div class="cards"><article><h2>1 · Set up trust</h2><p>Enroll a source you own. Keys are created and kept privately on this computer.</p><a class="button" href="#sources">Set up a source →</a></article><article><h2>2 · Bring evidence</h2><p>Upload an evidence-state document, incident JSONL, OTLP JSON, or APS fixture.</p><a class="button" href="#import">Import evidence →</a></article><article><h2>3 · Review findings</h2><p>See evidence states, coverage limits and reproducibility. Export a minimal summary with consent.</p><a class="button" href="#results">View results →</a></article></div><button id="diagnostics">Run offline diagnostics</button><pre id="diagnosticResult"></pre><button id="stop">Stop local dashboard</button></section>
<section id="sources" hidden><h1>Your sources & trust</h1><p>SELF_ATTESTED means customer-owned observations. CUSTOMER_ATTESTED signatures authenticate this workspace’s source; they do not establish external truth. Independent verification cannot be self-selected.</p><form id="enroll"><label>Source name <input id="sourceName" required maxlength="256" placeholder="my-audit-source"></label><button>Enroll my source</button></form><div id="sourceList"></div><h2>Key lifecycle</h2><p>Rotation retains retired keys for optional historical verification. Revocation permanently deletes a key and prevents historical verification. New records use active keys only.</p><div id="keyList"></div></section>
<section id="import" hidden><h1>Import & analyze</h1><p>Analyze as supplied makes no implicit trust choice. Uploads stay local. Never upload keys or credentials.</p><label>Format <select id="format"><option value="evidence">Evidence-state v1 · 2 MB</option><option value="jsonl">Incident JSONL · 32 MB</option><option value="otel">OTLP JSON · 32 MB</option><option value="aps">APS fixture · 32 MB</option></select></label><label>Choose a local file <input id="file" type="file" accept=".json,.jsonl,.ndjson"></label><button id="sample">Load synthetic example</button><label>Evidence content <textarea id="data" rows="12" placeholder="Choose a file or load the synthetic example"></textarea></label><button id="analyze">Analyze supplied claims</button><details><summary>Attest my own observations</summary><p class="warning">Attestation is not independent proof. Third-party uploaded data must remain supplied claims. Only proceed for records originating from a source you own.</p><label>My source <select id="sourceSelect"></select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="coverage"> Include my coverage completeness assertions in the exact review (optional)</label><button id="preview">Review exact records before signing</button><pre id="review"></pre><label><input type="checkbox" id="own"> I own the selected source and every listed origin record. I approve the exact context, horizon, record list, receipt bindings and any coverage assertions shown above.</label><button id="confirm" disabled>Confirm review & run assurance</button></details></section>
<section id="results" hidden><h1>Your results</h1><p>Coverage establishes only a producer’s scoped completeness assertion. No independent certification is delivered.</p><div id="reportList"></div><h2 id="resultTitle">Select a report</h2><p id="plainResult"></p><div id="stateRows"></div><details><summary>Detailed findings & key provenance</summary><pre id="result"></pre></details><label><input id="historical" type="checkbox"> Allow verification using retained retired keys</label><button id="verify" disabled>Verify saved report locally</button><label><input id="consent" type="checkbox"> I consent to export a minimal summary. Digests and identifiers can still be sensitive.</label><button id="export" disabled>Download summary JSON</button></section>
<section id="help" hidden><h1>Help, privacy & legal</h1><h2>What the states mean</h2><p>SUPPLIED_CLAIMS: uploaded assertions without workspace trust. CUSTOMER_ATTESTED: you signed your own observations. CUSTOMER_SOURCE_AUTHENTICATED: a record or exact coverage scope authenticated against your local source key, not independent verification. EXTERNAL_VERIFIED requires independent verifier provenance and is unavailable here. A certified badge requires an independent verifier.</p><p>KNOWN means a trusted receipt asserts delivery or consultation before the decision; it does not prove comprehension. MAYBE_AVAILABLE and NOT_ESTABLISHED preserve uncertainty. Missing coverage never proves absence. Authority, identity and causality remain unestablished.</p><h2>Local operation</h2><p>No account, hosted sign-in, billing, remote telemetry, model calls, scheduled jobs or automatic uploads. Each workspace is separate; this is not hosted multi-tenant isolation. Keep your workspace private and backed up securely. Keys never appear in pages or exports. Stop from Home or Ctrl-C; restart from your terminal. Each start prints a new one-use session link.</p><h2>Support & commercial boundaries</h2><p>There is no ticket submission service. Contact your own support channel separately, sharing only a reviewed summary. Independent assurance, connector operation, hosted authentication, business backend, tenant security assessment and payments remain separate work. No payment collection is implemented.</p><h2>About this release</h2><p>Agent Replay 0.6.0 · Customer workspace/report/export v1 · Evidence-state v1. Copyright 2026 Valentyn Rukhaylo / Altru.dev. This dashboard and core are Apache-2.0. Prior open-source grants remain intact. Future separately distributed paid connectors or assurance services may use separate terms; no exclusive rights to existing Apache-2.0 code are claimed. Agent Replay and Altru.dev trademarks are not licensed. Optional third-party integrations retain their own licenses; none is required by this dashboard. See the distribution LICENSE and NOTICE for full terms and attribution.</p></section></main><footer>◈ Local evidence workspace · No independent certification</footer></body></html>'''

CSS = '''*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f2f5f8;color:#172b3d;font:16px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif}body.dark{background:#101c29;color:#e1eaf3}header,nav,main,footer{padding:1rem max(5vw,1rem)}header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid #8193a544}header a{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:750}header span,.eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em}nav{display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}a{color:inherit}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;min-height:75vh}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.3rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.04em}h2{font-size:1.2rem}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:2rem 0}article,details{border:1px solid #8193a566;border-radius:14px;padding:1.3rem;margin:1rem 0}button,.button{display:inline-block;background:#17635f;color:white;border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:.7rem 1rem;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;margin:.4rem .4rem .4rem 0;text-decoration:none}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}label{display:block;margin:1rem 0}input:not([type=checkbox]),select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;max-width:850px;padding:.7rem;border:1px solid #8193a5;border-radius:7px;font:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit}input[type=checkbox]{width:1.15rem;height:1.15rem}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:.83rem;padding:1rem;background:#8193a518;border-radius:8px;max-height:38rem;overflow:auto}#notice,.warning{padding:.8rem;border-left:4px solid #c98e35;background:#c98e3515}footer{font-size:.8rem;opacity:.7}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d4a752;outline-offset:3px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:600px){header{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem}header span{display:none}nav{gap:.8rem}button{width:100%}}'''

JS = r'''"use strict";
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);let csrf='',state={},review=null,active=null,uploadedText=null;
const inputData=()=>uploadedText===null?$('data').value:uploadedText;
const show=(id,value)=>{$(id).textContent=typeof value==='string'?value:JSON.stringify(value,null,2)};
async function api(route,data){const r=await fetch('/api/'+route,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Replay-CSRF':csrf},body:JSON.stringify(data||{})});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error);return d}
function guard(fn){return async()=>{try{await fn()}catch(e){show('notice',e.message)}}}
function route(){const page=location.hash.slice(1);for(const s of document.querySelectorAll('main>section'))s.hidden=s.id!==(['home','sources','import','results','help'].includes(page)?page:'home')}
function button(text,fn,parent){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=text;b.onclick=guard(fn);parent.append(b)}
async function refresh(){const r=await fetch('/api/state',{headers:{'X-Replay-CSRF':csrf}});if(!r.ok)throw Error('Open the one-use session link printed by your server.');state=await r.json();$('sourceList').replaceChildren();$('sourceSelect').replaceChildren();$('keyList').replaceChildren();$('reportList').replaceChildren();for(const [name,s] of Object.entries(state.sources)){const p=document.createElement('article');p.textContent=name+' · '+s.mode;button('Rotate key',async()=>{await api('rotate',{source:name});review=null;await refresh();show('notice','New active key created. Previous key retained for historical verification.')},p);$('sourceList').append(p);const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=name;o.textContent=name;$('sourceSelect').append(o)}for(const [id,k] of Object.entries(state.keys)){const p=document.createElement('article');p.textContent=k.source+' · '+id+' · '+k.status;if(k.status!=='REVOKED')button('Revoke & permanently delete',async()=>{if(!confirm('Permanently delete this key? Historical cryptographic verification will become unavailable. Saved reports remain.'))return;await api('revoke',{key_id:id,acknowledgement:'REVOKE AND DELETE KEY; HISTORICAL VERIFICATION WILL BE UNAVAILABLE'});review=null;await refresh()},p);$('keyList').append(p)}for(const [id,r] of Object.entries(state.reports)){button(r.attestation+' · '+id.slice(0,12),()=>loadReport(id),$('reportList'))}}
async function loadReport(id){active=id;const r=await api('report',{report_id:id});show('resultTitle',r.attestation.replaceAll('_',' '));const usable=r.result.coverage?.some(c=>c.usable_for_exact_horizon);show('plainResult',r.format==='evidence'?(usable?'Exact coverage is authenticated against your own source. This remains your completeness assertion.':'Coverage is not established for the exact decision horizon. Missing evidence does not prove absence.'):'Incident reconstructed from supplied telemetry. This does not establish source honesty.');show('result',r);$('stateRows').replaceChildren();const meanings={KNOWN:'A source-authenticated receipt asserts delivery or consultation before the decision. This does not prove comprehension.',MAYBE_AVAILABLE:'A supplied receipt claims this was available. Prior knowledge is not authenticated.',LATER_OBSERVED:'This evidence was observed after the decision horizon.',NOT_ESTABLISHED:'There is no qualifying receipt establishing prior availability.'};if(r.format==='evidence'){for(const e of r.result.evidence){const article=document.createElement('article');const title=document.createElement('h2');title.textContent=e.kind+' · '+e.evidence_ref.slice(0,12);const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=meanings[e.knowledge]||'State not established.';const auth=document.createElement('p');auth.textContent=e.authenticity==='AUTHENTICATED_SOURCE'?'Origin authenticated against your own source key; not independent proof.':'Origin remains a supplied assertion.';article.append(title,p,auth);$('stateRows').append(article)}if(!r.result.evidence.length){const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent='No event records were supplied. Any absence conclusion is limited to the exact authenticated coverage scope.';$('stateRows').append(p)}}else{const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=(r.result.reconstruction_status==='DIVERGENCE_RECONSTRUCTED'?'A mismatch was reconstructed from supplied assertions.':'No divergence was established from the supplied assertions.')+' Evidence gaps: '+r.result.evidence_gaps.length+'. Structural completeness does not prove real-world capture completeness.';$('stateRows').append(p)}$('verify').disabled=false;$('export').disabled=false;location.hash='results'}
$('theme').onclick=()=>document.body.classList.toggle('dark');window.addEventListener('hashchange',route);
$('enroll').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();guard(async()=>{await api('enroll',{source:$('sourceName').value});await refresh();show('notice','Source enrolled. Your key stays in the private workspace.');$('sourceName').value=''})()};
$('diagnostics').onclick=guard(async()=>show('diagnosticResult',await api('diagnostics')));
$('stop').onclick=guard(async()=>{if(confirm('Stop the dashboard? Restart with the customer serve command.')){await api('stop');show('notice','Dashboard stopped. You may close this tab.')}});
$('file').onchange=guard(async()=>{const f=$('file').files[0];if(!f)return;if(f.size>($('format').value==='evidence'?2000000:32000000))throw Error('File exceeds this format’s upload limit.');uploadedText=new TextDecoder('utf-8',{fatal:true,ignoreBOM:true}).decode(await f.arrayBuffer());$('data').value=uploadedText;invalidate()});
function invalidate(){review=null;$('confirm').disabled=true;$('own').checked=false;show('review','')}
$('data').addEventListener('input',()=>{uploadedText=null;invalidate()});
for(const id of ['format','sourceSelect','coverage'])$(id).addEventListener('input',invalidate);
$('analyze').onclick=guard(async()=>{const r=await api('analyze',{data:inputData(),format:$('format').value});await refresh();await loadReport(r.report_id);show('notice','Analyzed as supplied claims. No implicit source trust.')});
$('preview').onclick=guard(async()=>{invalidate();review=await api('preview',{data:inputData(),format:$('format').value,source:$('sourceSelect').value,coverage:$('coverage').checked});show('review',review);$('confirm').disabled=false;show('notice','Review every proposed record and receipt binding. Coverage requires exact context and horizon acknowledgement below.')});
$('confirm').onclick=guard(async()=>{if(!review||!$('own').checked)throw Error('Review the exact records and check the ownership acknowledgement first.');const r=await api('analyze',{data:inputData(),format:'evidence',attest:true,own:true,confirmation:review.confirmation});invalidate();await refresh();await loadReport(r.report_id);show('notice','Customer-owned records attested. Independent certification is not established.')});
$('verify').onclick=guard(async()=>show('notice',await api('verify',{report_id:active,historical:$('historical').checked})));
$('export').onclick=guard(async()=>{const r=await api('export',{report_id:active,consent:$('consent').checked});const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(r,null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='agent-replay-summary.json';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(u)});
$('sample').onclick=()=>{uploadedText=null;$('format').value='evidence';$('data').value=JSON.stringify({schema:'agent-replay.evidence-state.v1',context_id:'synthetic-demo',decision:{actor_instance_id:'demo-agent',at:10,since:0,credential:'demo-credential',action:'pay',subject:'demo-resource',channel:'approval',source:'demo-audit'},events:[],receipts:[],coverage:[{manifest_id:'demo-manifest',source:'demo-audit',actor_instance_id:'demo-agent',channel:'approval',action:'pay',subject:'demo-resource',start:0,end:10,observed_at:11,ingested_at:12,complete:true,evidence_ids:[]}]},null,2);invalidate();show('notice','Synthetic sample loaded. Analyze claims, or enroll demo-audit to review your own synthetic coverage assertion.')};
(async()=>{try{const token=location.hash.slice(1);let d;if(token&&!['home','sources','import','results','help'].includes(token)){history.replaceState(null,'',location.pathname);d=await api('session',{token})}else{const r=await fetch('/api/resume',{headers:{'X-Replay-Resume':'1'}});if(!r.ok)throw Error('Open the full one-use session URL printed by your server. Restart the server for a fresh link.');d=await r.json()}csrf=d.csrf;await refresh();show('notice','Your private workspace is ready. Nothing leaves this computer.');route()}catch(e){show('notice',e.message)}})();
'''
